{
    glibc AVX2 wmemcmp reads 32-byte chunks and may overread past the end of
    a small heap block (std::wstring map-key compare).  Benign: the extra
    bytes stay within the same malloc chunk's page and are never used for
    the comparison result.  Known valgrind/glibc false positive (ifunc
    dispatch bypasses valgrind's memcmp interceptors).
    Memcheck:Addr32
    fun:__wmemcmp_avx2_movbe
}
